    "meta_description": "Understand heavy-metal testing in Bengaluru, exposure history and result limits. For price, sample and method, check with QXL for more information.",
    "canonical_url": "https://qxldiagnostics.com/blog/heavy-metal-toxicology-bengaluru",
    "slug": "heavy-metal-toxicology-bengaluru",
