    "seo_title": "FNAC and Pap Tests in Bengaluru: Different Cell Questions",
    "meta_description": "Understand FNAC and Pap cytology in Bengaluru, their different uses and report limits. For preparation and price, check with QXL for more information.",
    "canonical_url": "https://qxldiagnostics.com/blog/cytology-fnac-pap-bengaluru",
